  "notes": "{還元|かんげん} has both scientific and everyday meanings.\n\nWRITING:\n- {還|かん} (return, go back)\n- {元|げん} (origin, base)\n\nSENSE 1 (Chemistry):\n- {還元|かんげん}{剤|ざい} (reducing agent)\n- {還元|かんげん}{反応|はんのう} (reduction reaction)\n- {酸化|さんか}{還元|かんげん} (oxidation-reduction, redox)\n\nSENSE 2 (Business/Consumer):\n- ポイント{還元|かんげん} (point rewards)\n- {還元|かんげん}{率|りつ} (reward rate)\n- {税金|ぜいきん}{還元|かんげん} (tax return)\n- {社会|しゃかい}{還元|かんげん} (giving back to society)\n- {利益|りえき}{還元|かんげん} (profit sharing)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {還元|かんげん}する (to reduce; to return - suru verb)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {酸化|さんか} (oxidation - opposite in chemistry)",
